# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore
# Phase 0 task: read every line and be able to explain WHY it's here.
# Rule of thumb: ignore anything that is INSTALLED, GENERATED, PERSONAL or SECRET.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored (we commit these on purpose):
#   package-lock.json          reproducible installs (`npm ci`)
#   .env.example               documents which variables exist, with no real values
#   PROGRESS.md                your learning progress belongs in your repo
#   client/public/mockServiceWorker.js   generated by `msw init`, but MSW recommends committing it
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Dependencies (installed) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
jspm_packages/
.pnp.*
.yarn/install-state.gz
.pnpm-store/

# ── Build output (generated) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
out/
dev-dist/
# `dist/` above already covers this, but it's the Babel lab's output and worth naming:
labs/11-babel-jsx/dist/

# ── Caches (generated) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
.vite/
.rollup.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
vite.config.*.timestamp-*
.turbo/
.husky/_/

# ── Test, coverage & performance reports (generated) ─────────────────────────
coverage/
*.lcov
.nyc_output/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
blob-report/
test-results/
.lighthouseci/
lighthouse-report*.html
mongodb-binaries/

# ── Secrets & local environment (NEVER commit) ───────────────────────────────
# Leaked a secret? Rotate it first, then remove it from the history.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── Local databases & uploads (generated) ────────────────────────────────────
# Anchored with a leading slash and a path, so it can't swallow client/src/mocks/data/
/data/
server/data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
uploads/

# ── Logs (generated) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Temporary files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
.tmp/
temp/
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── Editors & IDEs (personal) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.fleet/
.history/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace
# Share the recommended extensions, keep personal editor settings out:
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── AI assistant local state (personal) ──────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.aider*

# ── Your own scratch notes (personal) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Anything ending in .local.md stays on your machine, e.g. interview-notes.local.md
*.local.md
